LOCATION:EF 103\, Boğaziçi University
DESCRIPTION:Week 4: Data Moves & Statistical Reasoning / CODAP\n\nPlan: loo
 k at a messy real dataset and guess a question it could answer\; mini-lect
 ure on data moves and CODAP's role in K-12 data literacy\; discussion of h
 ow data-driven inquiry differs from a traditional statistics worksheet.\n\
 nReading (post your initial reaction by Tuesday 8:00 AM): Hudson et al. (2
 025)\, Data moves as a focusing lens for learning to teach with CODAP (PDF
  in the class Drive folder).\n\nBefore Thursday: work through CODAP's Educ
 ators guide (https://codap.concord.org/educators/) and open one shared pra
 ctice dataset on your own.\n\nCourse website: https://serkanozeltx.github.
 io/sced470-fall2026/\nWeekly plans: https://serkanozeltx.github.io/sced470
 -fall2026/weekly-plans.html
